&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonded seals, often referred to as dowty seals or washers, are essential components in ensuring leak-free operations across a variety of industries. These seals consist of a metal washer with a vulcanized rubber sealing lip, providing a robust and durable solution for high-pressure environments and critical sealing needs.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
